      "checks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "spec-extract",
      "category": "summarization and extraction",
      "prompt": "Read this support ticket. Give a one-sentence summary, then a JSON object with fields product, severity, affected_users and next_step.\n\nTicket: Since Tuesday's update, the Nimbus backup agent on about forty office laptops stops at 90 percent and logs a checksum error. Restarting does not help. Restores still work, but no new backups have finished in three days. Our admin Dana rolled two machines back to the previous version and those are fine. We need guidance before the audit next week.",
      "checks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "spec-reason",
      "category": "reasoning",
      "prompt": "Four runners finish a relay with legs of 12, 15, 11 and 14 minutes. Each runner can swap legs with at most one teammate, and the team wants the two longest legs run by different people from the two shortest legs. List the valid arrangements under these rules, explain your reasoning step by step, and say which arrangement you would choose.",
      "checks": []
    }
  ],
